      <guid>https://stuartmccoll.github.io/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m currently a Lead Software Engineer at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kainos.com&#34;&gt;Kainos&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;where I build new products in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.workday.com&#34;&gt;Workday&lt;/a&gt; ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Formerly of&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.heritagefund.org.uk&#34;&gt;The National Lottery Heritage Fund&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry&#34;&gt;HM Land Registry&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;and Microtest (now &lt;a href=&#34;https://evahealth.co.uk/&#34;&gt;Eva Health Technologies&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I graduated from the &lt;a href=&#34;http://open.ac.uk&#34;&gt;Open University&lt;/a&gt; in 2020 with a BSc.&#xA;(Hons) in Computing and IT (Software), which I studied for alongside my&#xA;day job.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With almost ten years of industry experience, I have broad knowledge across a&#xA;number of programming languages and frameworks which I have used to build&#xA;customer-facing web applications; RESTful APIs; automated testing suites;&#xA;CI/CD pipelines; and complex integrations between existing systems. I&amp;rsquo;ve done&#xA;this in both the public and private sectors for mission critical projects&#xA;used by thousands of end users.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
